Subject: [PATCH] fix(guide): correct V-Carve stepdown and catalog block
 boundary

Pin the V-Carve Stepdown default at 5.
Skip only a complete leading generated catalog block in the icon test.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3275
